00:09:48.470 --> 00:09:49.810
I came back then I seen him.

00:09:49.810 --> 00:09:51.580
I always had faith I was
going to see him again.

00:09:51.580 --> 00:09:52.690
And I did.

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:55.350
So good things are happening
and bad things well.

00:09:55.350 --> 00:09:56.953
But just trying to hold on

00:09:56.953 --> 00:09:59.990
trying to hang in there as best I can say.

00:09:59.990 --> 00:10:02.778
- All right Valerie, thank
you so much for talking to me.

00:10:02.778 --> 00:10:03.646
- You're welcome.

00:10:03.646 --> 00:10:04.561
- Good luck to you.

00:10:04.561 --> 00:10:05.561
- Thank you.

